{"synopsis":"**Dari Artist yang mengerjakan *Noblesse!***\n\nArchimond, Sang Necromancer Terkuat yang Pernah Menebar Teror di Seluruh Benua.\n\nNyawanya melayang di ujung pedang sang pahlawan, Berkel Reinland.\n\nDan 200 tahun kemudian... ia terlahir kembali sebagai bayi dari sebuah keluarga bangsawan.\n\nKata-kata pertama yang terucap dari bibirnya:\n\n**\"Wahai para penjaga kegelapan, para kaki tangan, dan seluruh pasukanku... taatilah perintahku!\"**","alternative_title":"검술명가의 네크로맨서","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","chapters":[{"number":"21","chapter":"21","slug":"ch_21","kc_index":null,"kc_series_slug":null,"date":"2026-08-03"},{"chapter_id":"af203802-7ebd-4350-9453-e0d55cc4590a","number":"20","chapter":"20","title":"","date":"2026-08-01","released":"2026-08-01","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_17ae038f-8876-4d1e-a679-0235fc4ae80b/chapter_ch_20/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_17ae038f-8876-4d1e-a679-0235fc4ae80b/chapter_ch_20/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_17ae038f-8876-4d1e-a679-0235fc4ae80b/chapter_ch_20/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_17ae038f-8876-4d1e-a679-0235fc4ae80b/chapter_ch_20/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_17ae038f-8876-4d1e-a679-0235fc4ae80b/chapter_ch_20/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_17ae038f-8876-4d1e-a679-0235fc4ae80b/chapter_ch_20/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_17ae038f-8876-4d1e-a679-0235fc4ae80b/chapter_ch_20/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_17ae038f-8876-4d1e-a679-0235fc4ae80b/chapter_ch_20/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_17ae038f-8876-4d1e-a679-0235fc4ae80b/chapter_ch_20/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_17ae038f-8876-4d1e-a679-0235fc4ae80b/chapter_ch_20/10.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"2915a283-2808-49d2-b1aa-373d85d5781c","number":"19","chapter":"19","title":"","date":"2026-07-24","released":"2026-07-24","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_17ae038f-8876-4d1e-a679-0235fc4ae80